      "message": "Yes, the two calculation are equivalent. I think that idle_dsleep_time_us keeps time spent in deep sleep, so rtc_sleep and rtc1 should be as close as possible to WFI instruction.\n\nOn the other side, idle_dsleep_time_us is only printed to user, so it\u0027s acceptable for this to be imprecise, but pointer to struct rtc_time_reg passed set_rtc_alarm() can\u0027t be null.",
